{
  "$comment": "One statement of how a quota reading is read. `freshness` is how long one reading describes current quota; `merge` is how Relay resolves the readings of an account into one subscription per key; `two_way_merge` is the one comparison Relay cannot make \u2014 a resolved row against the local reading of the machine in front of you, which only QuotaBar's service has.",
